@startuml 哪吒网络安全SIEM隔离与主动响应
!theme mars
title 哪吒网络安全 SIEM — 隔离与主动响应流程

actor 攻击者
participant "PacketCapture" as Capture
participant "Detector" as Detector
participant "DatabaseHelper" as DB
database "SQLite\nnezha_quarantine.db" as SQLite
participant "ActiveResponse" as Response
participant "AlertManager" as Alert

攻击者 -> Capture : ICMP ping (大量)
Capture -> Detector : 持续分析

loop ICMP count >= 5
    Detector -> Alert : 创建告警\n"端口扫描 | ICMP洪流"
end

Detector -> Detector : entry.count >= AnomaliesQuarantineThreshold (100)
Detector -> DB : QuarantineIP(ip, "ICMP异常流量", score)

DB -> DB : g_quarantine_cache.insert(ip)
DB -> SQLite : INSERT OR REPLACE\nINTO quarantine
SQLite --> DB : OK

note over DB : 内存 O(1) 查询 + SQLite 持久化

攻击者 -> Capture : 继续发包 (已被隔离)
Capture -> DB : IsIPQuarantined(ip)
DB --> Capture : true (内存命中, <1μs)

Capture -> Capture : last_warn 去重检查
Capture -> Alert : 每10s最多1条\n"已隔离 IP 被拦截: x.x.x.x"

Capture -> Response : send_icmp_unreachable()
note over Response : 构建原始 ICMP 包\nType=3 Code=1\n原始IP头 + 8字节载荷

Response -> 攻击者 : ICMP Destination Unreachable
note over 攻击者 : ping 显示\n"Destination Host Unreachable"

@enduml
